{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000024726","bookName":"La gorda que forjó un emperador","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000024726/42000024726.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":296999,"followCount":10466,"introduction":"Sueira López renace en Aeterna como esposa obesa menospreciada. Originalmente, ella y su hijo mueren trágicamente. Para cambiar su destino, transforma su cuerpo con su hijo y frustra las conspiraciones de Gloria Yus con el Supermercado Temporal. Salva a la Emperatriz Viuda y al Emperador, sofoca rebeliones y gana el favor popular. Aunque el Emperador la ama, ella lo rechaza. Cuando su hijo reina, Sueira deja el palacio y vive libre.","chapterCount":60,"labels":["Palace Intrigue","Transmigration"],"tags":["Palace Intrigue","Transmigration"],"typeTwoIds":[336],"typeTwoNames":["Contraataque"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":336,"name":"Contraataque","replaceName":"contraataque"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Contraataque","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"La-gorda-que-forjó-un-emperador","bookNameLower":"la-gorda-que-forjó-un-emperador","shelfTime":"2026-08-15 00:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-15 00:00:00","performerList":[{"performerId":"26775","performerName":"Jingxin Mao","performerFormatName":"Jingxin-Mao","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/5x7/26775/26775.jpg?time=1786686288924","videoCount":1},{"performerId":"19818","performerName":"Yue Lv","performerFormatName":"Yue-Lv","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/8x1/19818/19818.jpg?time=1786686289444","videoCount":1}],"performerIdList":[19818,26775]},"chapterList":[{"id":"701479966","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/66/6x2/62x7/627x4/62742000024/701479966_1/701479966.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795219200&Signature=wI3dB0q~lJs~Cmj2cjg57qodg7uKfLGqbBrHxw9xwkIHb6OqV19DB~~QZzWppTsDoL5qGouKD3~VNoG1xykhY5HcqRMfVU5BUv9-poCNDnYRwVgSS1-ON8KomY90MgB0WvjBpdFj4RYJEm1T3MQbRSbFF3fdAowzOdVGE